{"id":"u-342cfdf4-a0e9-4509-87de-cf32fb62645e","src":"community","title":"John Arthur Method (Strength Focus)","author":"John M.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/w1oGmE-john-arthur-method-strength-focus","desc":"Month long program designed to help you make progress for a long time. Once you have run out of runway on linear programs this will help you manage fatigue and keep steady progress. Eccentric under control. Concentric should be full speed you are capable of, train force production. Trust the % on the compounds and save failure training for isolation work. Only raise backoff % if lifts stall, ex: 65%  -> 70%. After month is over add ~ 10lbs for lower body lifts and ~ 5 lbs to upper body lifts and reset with new 1 RM % and repeat. \n\nAdd arm days whenever you want but keep it moderate weight. Recommend myo reps or 2 sets of 8-12 with 2nd set to failure. \n\nSuggest for...\n\nBiceps: Incline bicep curls taken to failure and then hammer curls to failure.\n\nTriceps: Dumbbell skull crushers\n\nWrists:  Curls in the 15-20 rep range and rice bucket work\n\nAnkles: balance board and tib raises\n\nNeck: harness or forehead plate raises\n\nCore: ab wheel, suitcase carries, leg raises, back extension","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Athletics","Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-28T18:18:41.675Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["L 3","U 3","L 2","U 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":86},{"r":4,"pct":83},{"r":4,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":83},{"r":4,"pct":76},{"r":4,"pct":65}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9},{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":9},{"lo":6,"hi":10,"rpe":10}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":2,"pct":86},{"r":4,"pct":83},{"r":4,"pct":65,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":4,"pct":83}